;: route.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: direct connects and Longlines
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk GF
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A:B G:A:C DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*B
Equate G = A+C
Endblk
Editblk GG
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A@B
Endblk
Editblk HF
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:D G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ~A*D
Endblk
Editblk FF
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:C G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A+~C
Endblk
Editblk BJ
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Endblk
Editblk DJ
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ~A
Endblk
Editblk HJ
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Endblk
Editblk KJ
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ~A
Endblk
Editblk JB
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Endblk
Editblk EE
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*~B
Endblk
Editblk P29
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P30
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P58
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P59
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P60
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P61
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P62
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P63
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P66
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P67
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P68
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P69
Base IO
Config IN:PULLUP OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Addnet A0 P29.I GF.A HF.A FF.A
Addnet A1 P30.I GF.B GF.C
Addnet COL P58.I BJ.A DJ.A HJ.A KJ.A JB.A EE.B
Addnet XG GF.X GG.A
Addnet YG GF.Y GG.B HF.D FF.C
Addnet O0 GG.X P59.O
Addnet O1 HF.X P60.O
Addnet O2 FF.X P61.O
Addnet O3 BJ.X P62.O
Addnet O4 DJ.X P63.O
Addnet O5 HJ.X P66.O
Addnet O6 KJ.X P67.O
Addnet O7 JB.X EE.A
Addnet O8 EE.X P68.O
